{"3723640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Prenecrotic: The Cursed School VR", "steam_appid": 3723640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENGAGING STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of <strong>Jason</strong>, a man desperate to uncover the truth behind his wife's mysterious disappearance inside a remote and decaying school. What begins as a simple search spiral into a nightmarish descent through shadowed hallways, blood-soaked classrooms, and twisted alternate realities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723640/extras/1280x720.png?t=1786102820\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HORROR VR EXPRIENCE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built from the ground up for <strong>Virtual Reality</strong>, <i>Prenecrotic</i> delivers a deeply immersive and psychologically disturbing horror experience. Face terrifying, otherworldly creatures, gather cryptic clues, and solve environmental puzzles to uncover the school’s cursed history — and the secrets it’s dying to keep.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔑 <strong>Key Features</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VR-Only Immersion</strong><br>Every scare, every sound, every shadow — feel it all in full virtual reality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative-Driven Horror</strong><br>Uncover a dark, emotional story as you piece together your wife's final steps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tense Exploration &amp; Survival</strong><br>Use found tools and instinct to survive unpredictable encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reality-Bending Mechanics</strong><br>Shift between worlds using a cursed doll to unlock new paths — and new horrors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Puzzle Solving</strong><br>Decipher cryptic messages, keys, and blood-stained notes to progress deeper into the darkness.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>“If you’re interested, don’t forget to add to your Wishlist – it really helps us!”</strong></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENGAGING STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of <strong>Jason</strong>, a man desperate to uncover the truth behind his wife's mysterious disappearance inside a remote and decaying school. What begins as a simple search spiral into a nightmarish descent through shadowed hallways, blood-soaked classrooms, and twisted alternate realities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723640/extras/1280x720.png?t=1786102820\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HORROR VR EXPRIENCE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built from the ground up for <strong>Virtual Reality</strong>, <i>Prenecrotic</i> delivers a deeply immersive and psychologically disturbing horror experience. Face terrifying, otherworldly creatures, gather cryptic clues, and solve environmental puzzles to uncover the school’s cursed history — and the secrets it’s dying to keep.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔑 <strong>Key Features</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VR-Only Immersion</strong><br>Every scare, every sound, every shadow — feel it all in full virtual reality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative-Driven Horror</strong><br>Uncover a dark, emotional story as you piece together your wife's final steps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tense Exploration &amp; Survival</strong><br>Use found tools and instinct to survive unpredictable encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reality-Bending Mechanics</strong><br>Shift between worlds using a cursed doll to unlock new paths — and new horrors.</p></li><li><p c